298
00:18:37,240 --> 00:18:39,200
Oh, my God! No!

299
00:18:39,520 --> 00:18:40,720
They've all lost it!

300
00:18:41,240 --> 00:18:44,217
This damn heat has driven
them all completely insane.

301
00:18:44,300 --> 00:18:47,020
