302
00:18:48,980 --> 00:18:51,800
Hey, Jotaro, get a hold of yourself, man.

303
00:18:51,980 --> 00:18:53,377
You have to settle down.

304
00:18:53,460 --> 00:18:55,397
You need to listen to me, Jotaro.

305
00:18:55,480 --> 00:18:59,937
Sometimes things get rough, but when
they do, you have to remain in control.

306
00:19:00,020 --> 00:19:03,237
Please, please don't get the
wrong idea about this, Mr.

307
