that's sitting on the opposite side.

312
00:19:21,020 --> 00:19:22,837
Opposite side huh.

313
00:19:22,920 --> 00:19:28,517
Um you still don't see it sir?

314
00:19:28,600 --> 00:19:31,757
Have another look there's
a rock that's exactly

